# Persistence

Two layers: **localStorage** for app state; **IndexedDB** for IDE virtual filesystems.

## localStorage keys

Canonical list: `BACKUP_STORAGE_KEYS` in `src/lib/backup.js`.

| Key | Store / owner | Contents |
|-----|---------------|----------|
| `system-design-copilot-progress-v4` | `stores/progress.js` | `completedLessonIds[]` |
| `system-design-copilot-practice-v1` | `stores/practice.js` | Per-key drafts `{ answer, savedAt, timer? }` — keys like `{lessonId}/{stepId}`, `dsa-practice:…`, `dsa-exercise:…`, or `dsa-attempt:…` |
| `system-design-copilot-simulation-v1` | `stores/simulation.js` | Per-`lessonId` simulation session |
| `system-design-copilot-llm-v1` | `stores/llm.js` | Provider, endpoint, model, apiKey, templates, systemPrompt |
| `system-design-copilot-sidebar-v4` | `+layout.svelte` | Sidebar open/filter UI (not a store) |
| `system-design-copilot-theme-v1` | `stores/theme.js` | Active color theme id (12 dark + 13 light schemes in `themes.js`; sets `data-theme-mode` on `<html>`) |

Question-bank completion flags also use localStorage keys like `question-bank:{key}:completed` (see `QuestionBankIDE.svelte`). Reading answers for Check (AI) use practice-store keys `question-bank-answer:{bankKey}:{itemId}`.

ML Practice IDE drafts use per-exercise keys `ml-practice:{lessonId}:{exerciseId}` (localStorage; not in the backup key list).

Timer state machine helpers: `stores/practiceTimer.js` (nested under practice answers).

## IndexedDB workspaces

- Module: `src/lib/editor/indexedDbWorkspace.js`
- DB: `system-design-copilot-workspaces`, store: `workspaces`
- Used by `IDEWorkspace` / editor layer for multi-file snapshots (practice, simulation, DSA, etc.)
- Workspace ids are namespaced (e.g. `practice:{lesson.id}`)

Editor core: `editor/workspaceCore.js`, `editor/workspace.js`.

## Backup

`src/lib/backup.js` + `ProgressControls.svelte` — export/import all backup keys and IndexedDB workspaces; reset progress.

## Agent notes

- Do not assume IndexedDB alone holds user progress — most durable state is localStorage.
- Bump key suffixes carefully; update `backup.js` and docs together.
- Tests: `tests/backup.test.js`, `tests/workspace.test.js`.
